    "answer": {
      "short": "${}^{6}P_{3}=120$",
      "worked": "Choose and order three of the six distinct letters without repetition.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}{}^{6}P_{3}&=\\frac{6!}{(6-3)!}\\\\{}^{6}P_{3}&=\\frac{6!}{3!}\\\\{}^{6}P_{3}&=120\\end{align*}$$\n\nThere are 120 codes.",
